<title>JAPAN: Friendly Corp - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Friendly Corp - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  8.35		vs	    7.54</p>
<p> Operating	  775 million	 vs	  633 million</p>
<p> Current	    741 million	 vs	  590 million</p>
<p> Net		  321 million	 vs	  426 million</p>
<p> EPS		   20.39 yen	  vs	   27.12 yen</p>
<p> Shares		16 million	 vs	   16 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  3.75 yen	  vs	    3.75 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Friendly Corp is a suburban family restaurant owner.</p>
